<title>INDIA: CRICKET - INDIA DECLARE, SET S.AFRICA 461-RUN TARGET.</title>
<headline>CRICKET - INDIA DECLARE, SET S.AFRICA 461-RUN TARGET.</headline>
<dateline>KANPUR, India 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>India set South Africa a 461-run victory target when they declared their second innings closed at the lunch-time score of 400 for seven wickets on the fourth day of their third and final cricket test on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 237 and 400-7 declared. South Africa 177.</p>
